    "summary": "Adds a test data hydration layer to the Factory pipeline, enabling adapters to generate seed SQL for reference/lookup tables, realistic development fixtures for all domain entities, and a shared test fixture module consumed by both unit and integration tests. Closes the gap between schema-only DDL output and a runnable application with meaningful data.\n",
